  "id": "724a9e55727c82cc0c5ad7d3c4479cfb69be791b",
  "message": "wp433 P2c-C1: tren Windows credentials.json cua gws (W4, W5) chi ghi toi o cuc bo, ngoai kho git, khong xuyen lien ket\n\nDac ta GWS-CRED-DICH-NGOAI-KHO-C1 r1 (sha256 758782c72e86...), lease wp433-r4-g1-claude, Issue #433.\n\n- M1 `_phan_loai_duong_nt(p)`: phan loai thuan (ntpath.splitdrive + regex, khong cham he tep). Nhan duong o\n  co chu tuyet doi va duong tuong doi; tu choi theo thu tu NUL, trang, `\\\\?\\`, `\\\\.\\`, `\\??\\`, UNC, o tran,\n  o tuong doi, goc o khong chu, o khac, `..`, ky tu cam / surrogate, cuoi cham-cach, ten thiet bi\n  (ke ca COM0/LPT0, chu so mu, CONIN$/CONOUT$).\n- M2 `_duong_dich_chuan_nt(p, cwd, loai_o=None)`: ghep THANH PHAN vao cwd; chi nhan loai o REMOVABLE (2) va\n  FIXED (3) theo `GetDriveTypeW` nap luoi (`_loai_o_nt`); ly do mot dong `duong khong hop le: repr(x)[:200]`.\n- M3 `_dich_cred_gws_nt`: nhanh `os.name != \"posix\"` cua `_dich_cred_gws` goi ham nay. Thu tu: chuan hoa;\n  do `.git` ba trang thai tren chuoi tu vung; `_kiem_dich_ghi` tu goc o (lien ket o moi tien to, ke ca\n  symlink treo); do `.git` tren chuoi that (`realpath(strict=True)` cua to tien gan nhat dang ton tai).\n  Loi `lstat`/`realpath` ngoai \"chua co\" lan ra thanh `ghi loi` o W4/W5.\n- M4: giu sau cum loi cua P2a, khong them cum; moi tu choi xay ra truoc writer.\n- M5: fragment wp433_gws_cred_win_duong: 3 ca / 76 luot (47 + 18 + 11), 47 dot bien (39 moi nen, 8 chi nt),\n  3 tu kiem phan hang, so luot va danh sach ID viet rieng.\n- M6: tai sinh scripts/tl_test_fragments_bundled.py bang generate_bundled_module_bytes.\n\nKhong sua than `_kiem_dich_ghi`, `_ghi_nguyen_tu_0600`, `_trong_kho_git`, `_duong_dich_chuan`; W4, W5 khong\ndoi. Ca `tich_hop_nt` va 8 dot bien nen nt CHUA chay tren Windows that (do native §4c do phien dieu phoi chay).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxrYktHKop1BsgG1zjmZ",
  "timestamp": "2026-11-19T14:19:56Z",
  "tree_id": "e942f6a320ed927ffcf85310e75929ac4443a4fe"
 },
